# This repo mirrors the site's document root, but only tracks
# wp-content/ (custom themes, plugins, uploads). WordPress core
# (wp-admin, wp-includes, root wp-*.php files) is vendor code --
# trivially reinstalled from wordpress.org, not something anyone edits,
# not worth the bloat of tracking. /manage/ is its own fully separate
# git repo (mqcarpenter/rotc26) with its own deploy workflow -- ignored
# here (implicitly, by not being wp-content) so the two never collide.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/wp-content

# The backup archives themselves must never be committed -- these are
# multi-hundred-MB tar/zip files, not source content.
wp-content/backuply/
wp-content/backups-dup-lite/

# WordPress core, plugin, and cache-generated data, none of it source.
wp-content/upgrade/
wp-content/upgrade-temp-backup/
wp-content/litespeed/

.DS_Store
